# .secrets-allowlist: exceptions for false positives in secret scanning.
# Format: path-glob|pattern-id|human-readable reason
# Every entry requires an explicit human-readable reason.

go.sum|high-entropy-token|Go module checksums are public cryptographic hashes, not secrets
web/package-lock.json|high-entropy-token|npm lockfile integrity hashes are public checksums, not secrets
cmd/hearthd/upgrade_test.go|door-token|Deterministic in-test fixture tokens; never leave the test tempdir
scripts/upgrade-drill.sh|door-token|Deliberately-invalid drill probe token; the assertion expects 401
